### Home
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Get All Tasks (via /api/tasks)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### Get All Tasks (via /tasks)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks

### Get Task Statistics
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/stats

### Get Single Task
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1

### Create New Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete React project",
  "description": "Build the frontend for task manager",
  "priority": "high"
}

### Create Another Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express",
  "description": "Study REST API concepts",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### Update Task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "high"
}

### Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1

### Delete All Tasks
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### Test Validation (Should fail - no title -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "No title provided"
}

### Test Content-Type Validation (Should fail -> 415 Unsupported Media Type)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: text/plain

title=InvalidContentType